      "text": "SpaceXAI just literally shared its engineering team’s Grok Bots with everyone\n\nAnd Grok Bots just got much more powerful for building software\n\nBots can now hand off coding tasks directly to Cursor, manage PRs using GitHub and Origin plugins, and even share video demos of what they built\n\nOn top of that, SpaceXAI is now sharing the same Bots its engineering team built for real software work...and you can install them as templates\n\nThey come with their skills, routines and connectors already set up\n\nThere are Bots for:\n\n• Engineering lead\n• QA\n• Nightly code audits\n• Managing projects\n• Research + fact checking\n• Supervising cloud coding agents\n• Writing code and triaging issues\n\nThis is such a cool move by the SpaceXAI team\n\nInstead of just giving people an AI model, SpaceXAI just shared the actual agent workflows teams use internally to get the work done\n\nYou can basically install an AI engineering team now",
